# Save My Sister (jeuno 1), the other entry and a full inventory: Baudin's 172 (Prog 0 -> 1), then a GM sets Prog 4;
# Baudin's 107 with no room for the Holy Mace (not completed, Prog kept), then with room (completed).
# Jeuno fame 225 (level 4): 150/150/150.
lists UpperJeuno/Baudin/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/172 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/107
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-74.9,-1.2,80.0
fame Sandoria 150
fame Bastok 150
fame Windurst 150
quest Jeuno.CrestOfDavoi completed
login
trigger Baudin                        # Prog 0: 172
finish                                # Prog 1
charvar Quest[3][1]Prog 4             # a GM
trigger Baudin                        # Prog 4: 107
fill-inventory
finish                                # no room for the Holy Mace: not completed, nothing given, Prog 4 kept
free-inventory
trigger Baudin                        # 107 again
finish                                # completed: 3000 gil, Holy Mace, Exorcist in Training, fame +13 x3
